  "$comment": "K3 — Sorani Kurdish DRAFTS. status is ai-suggested for every entry, and NOTHING here is loaded by the app: apps/ must never import this file (asserted by tests/i18n/drafts.test.mjs). A reviewer promotes a string with `node scripts/i18n-review.mjs --promote <key>`, which moves it into apps/web/src/locales/ckb.json — the only file the app reads. REJECTING A DRAFT IS THE EXPECTED OUTCOME FOR MANY OF THESE. They were written by a model with no way to verify its Sorani is idiomatic for Erbil, and `note` marks where a term has competing forms. Correcting them is the job; approving them unread defeats the entire mechanism. religious and brand keys are NOT drafted here and never will be.",
